node_modules/
# `tsc` output, an intermediate on the way to the component.
build/

# THE COMPONENT IS COMMITTED, and the root .gitignore excludes `dist/` everywhere.
#
# Without these two lines the artifact is silently dropped from every commit, `build.rs` then
# fails on a fresh clone with "the committed TypeScript hook component is missing", and the
# person who hits it is not the person who caused it. Both lines are needed: git cannot
# re-include a file whose parent DIRECTORY is excluded, so the directory has to be un-excluded
# before the file can be.
!dist/
!dist/token-customize.wasm
